    "github": "https://github.com/devalexmuha/thirteenflies",
    "title": "API for [“Thirteen Flies”](https://github.com/devalexmuha/thirteenflies) e-commerce music store with Filament as admin panel",
    "description": "Backend for a musical instruments store: a REST API (/api/v1) for a Next.js storefront, plus a Filament admin panel built from reusable fields and layouts. It has 4 languages, a nested category tree, product filters, brands, promotions, blog, services, authors, reviews and a wishlist. SEO is built in from day one: meta tag templates, robots.txt managed from the admin panel, a sitemap and a redirects module. Checkout is implemented with Stripe: a payment is confirmed only through a signed webhook, and after that the customer receives a confirmation email.",
