    "github": "https://github.com/devalexmuha/sol4",
    "title": "[“Sol4”](https://github.com/devalexmuha/sol4): first social media for Mars colonists",
    "description": "“Sol4: a new day on the 4th planet.” A Laravel + Blade social network where colonists can register, post photos, share short text thoughts; tag, like and comment posts and follow each other. I built it on purpose to design my first database by hand and use nearly every Eloquent relationship. It also has Policies and queued image optimization.",
